I think the Rogue quest is flawed--or unduly difficult.  I have discussed
this with _several_ people before and no-one seems to know of a solution.
I've been playing in discover mode, and saved the game just before I entered
the bottom level of the Rogue quest.  It seems that the stairs will deposit
you in a random area of the bottom level each game.  If you don't happen to
enter onto the center area, or into someplace that you can get to the center
area from, then it appears you're stuck.  There aren't many secret doors on
the level, and some areas just seem to be completely sealed off.  So arises
the age-old question:  Is it a Bug or a Feature?
(BTW I'm playing 3.1.1.)
